If you desire ordination and full admission into monkhood (<s>bhikṣubhāva</s>) in the well-proclaimed <s>Dharma</s> and <s>Vinaya</s>, come — let us go to the <s>Bhagavān</s>'s presence. The <s>Bhagavān</s> will ordain you.' He consented.

By austerity, having overcome all evil;
by austerity, having overcome the entire world;
