  What do you think, monks? He who was the countryside <s>ṛṣi</s> who split that <s>ṛṣi</s>'s assembly — that was none other than myself at that time, in that era. He who was the resident <s>ṛṣi</s> — that is none other than <s>Devadatta</s> at that time, in that era. Because I split his assembly, by the ripening of that <s>karma</s>, and because he made a wrongful aspiration, my <s>Saṅgha</s> has been split by him. Therefore, monks, karmas that are exclusively dark — as before — thus, monks, should you train.
